msgstr "通过 pygeofetch 的波段别名表进行匹配——请参见下方说明，而不只是不区分大小写的字符串匹配。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid "`check_processing_level`"
msgstr ""

