msgstr "拒绝不属于 `expected_level` 的场景。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid "`expected_level`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid "`\"Level-2A\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid ""
"Matched loosely — `\"L2A\"`, `\"Level-2A\"`, `\"S2MSI2A\"`, pygeofetch's own"
" `ProcessingLevel.L2A`, and a STAC collection id like `\"sentinel-2-l2a\"` "
"all compare equal — see the note below."
msgstr ""
"宽松匹配——`\"L2A\"`、`\"Level-2A\"`、`\"S2MSI2A\"`、pygeofetch 自己的 "
"`ProcessingLevel.L2A`，以及像 `\"sentinel-2-l2a\"` 这样的 STAC 集合 ID "
"都视为相等——请参见下方说明。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
