"— see the note below."
msgstr "启发式：标记 AOI 大部分位于场景边缘区域的场景。默认关闭，以避免对确实靠近边缘的 AOI 产生误报——请参见下方说明。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid "`nodata_margin_buffer_deg`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid "`0.01`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid ""
"How far to shrink the footprint inward (degrees, ~1 km at the equator) "
"before checking AOI overlap."
msgstr "在检查 AOI 重叠之前，将覆盖范围向内收缩的幅度（度，赤道处约 1 km）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid "`nodata_margin_min_aoi_fraction`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid "`0.5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid ""
"Minimum fraction of the AOI that must fall within the shrunk footprint to be"
" considered safe."
msgstr "AOI 落在收缩后覆盖范围内、才算安全的最小比例。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/optical-validation.md:56
msgid "`check_temporal_bounds`"
msgstr ""

